{"ID":"20240522082259-e9pgijv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082259-e9pgijv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082259-e9pgijv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082259-hqmj3hj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085711-vne6aj5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085711-gq1zsuv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"癲癇症的治療","type":"doc","updated":"20240522085754"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522082259-hqmj3hj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082259-hqmj3hj","updated":"20240522085706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"癲癇症"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-ri4wdrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-ri4wdrl","updated":"20240522085717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2008/08/27："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-wn6mby8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-wn6mby8","updated":"20240522085718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"   5歲時因發燒肺炎昏迷，之後有癲癇病史。近日發作頻率較多，發作時昏迷（跌倒撞傷導致右肩關節有脫臼病史）、全身抽筋、肌肉緊繃 、食慾可，每天排便，小便偶色黃，偶覺頭皮麻，偶怕冷，下午疲倦，眠可，舌質紫紅，目前服抗癲癇西藥（depakine）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-0hr3460","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-0hr3460","updated":"20240522085711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經學生診斷後認為其癲癇與腸胃及肝功能異常有直接的關係，處方配伍也因此而來。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-upie3j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-upie3j0","updated":"20240522085719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"處方： 大柴胡湯5  理中湯4  厚朴1.5 附子1.5 細辛1.5（克），3×7"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-007rcii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-007rcii","updated":"20240522085720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2008/09/03："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-2qrgl5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-2qrgl5z","updated":"20240522085721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服藥後本週癲癇未再發作，食慾可，每天排便，小便偶色黃改善，已不覺頭皮麻，本週亦無怕冷現象，下午疲倦感改善，眠可，舌質紫紅"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-08pwf0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-08pwf0p","updated":"20240522085721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"處方： （1）大柴胡湯4  理中湯4  厚朴1.0 附子1.0 細辛1.5 當歸1.5（克），3×3，並加用水藥7帖（處方架構同科學中藥）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-gqymuuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-gqymuuo","updated":"20240522085727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"           （2）我有幫他將右肩關節重新整復過，病患自述處理後活動較順暢。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-glbqcb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-glbqcb6","updated":"20240522085711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"持續治療中，有進一步進展再向您報告。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-l9cywo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-l9cywo0","updated":"20240522085741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"09/18/2008再次複診後，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-vkupe2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-vkupe2q","updated":"20240522085711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨晚癲癇的大學生病患回診，自述這2週完全沒有再發作，其母因仍擔心，不敢完全停西藥，目前減半服用抗癲癇西藥depakine，右肩關節相關症狀則未再提起。本次診斷後左脈緊滑關帶有弱象、右脈緊滑寸沈弱，修改處方如下："}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-wjlz96d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-wjlz96d","updated":"20240522085736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"當歸四逆湯4.5 大柴胡湯3  理中湯4  附子1.2 黃耆1.5（克），3×14（因病患已開學，課業忙不方便煮水藥。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-80fkm8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-80fkm8a","updated":"20240522085737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"並囑咐子時前要入睡、每天需跑步運動、禁食生冷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-ws4uike","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-ws4uike","updated":"20240522085711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很巧的，廖X梅昨晚也回診，原因是昨天血壓突然升高、頭痛，詳細診察後，原來是前天晚上和先生吵架引起的，真是被她打敗了......。針太衝、內關後搞定。持續追蹤。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-g2gyl5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-g2gyl5x","updated":"20240522085743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(附註: 這位廖小姐是位腎衰竭病患，但是由於她跟家人非常了解西醫的洗腎只是一時可以，等到哪一天無法再洗腎時，就是最後的那一天來臨了，所以她非常堅持不要洗腎，很聰明的決定啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-1ykz50e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-1ykz50e","updated":"20240522085711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-sfv3krq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-sfv3krq","updated":"20240522085711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢醫門人敬記於台中09/03/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-gq1zsuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-gq1zsuv","updated":"20240522085754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-4ey4a4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-4ey4a4s","updated":"20240522085711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    人紀DVD中就有有關癲癇症的診斷方式，治療此症時須要臨症才能處方，這位同學非常優秀，臨症處方將依據個人不盡相同的症狀而決定使用那個處方，這種正確的診斷與處方，才是對病情真正有幫助的，當個西醫師太簡單，每個癲癇病人來，只要開立同樣的藥物就可以了，無須深入思考，所以西醫是治不好癲癇的。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085711-vne6aj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085711-vne6aj5","updated":"20240522085711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈謹記於佛州09/04/2008"}]}]}